    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You've finally got one of your experiments to work (mostly). As a Bonus Action, you throw a gadget at a point you can see within 30 feet, where it goes off in a 10-foot-radius Sphere. Choose how it goes off:</p><ul><li><strong>Bang.</strong> Each creature in the Sphere makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 2d6 Thunder damage and has the Deafened condition until the end of its next turn.</li><li><strong>Smoke.</strong> The Sphere is Heavily Obscured until the end of your next turn.</li><li><strong>Sticky.</strong> Each creature in the Sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, it has the Restrained condition until it or another creature takes an action to pull it free.</li></ul><p>The save DC equals 8 plus your Intelligence modifier and Proficiency Bonus. Once you use this trait, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
